{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Does Rolling the Dice Decide a Person's Ending?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Making Ending</strong> is a casual game designed to answer three questions you might have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366060/extras/image.png?t=1743506975\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can life be determined by rolling a die?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if a game had no gameplay\u2014only endings, like watching internet shorts? Would it still be fun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of ending do I truly want?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick Play:</strong> While rolling the dice, you can experience the game at a fast pace. Anyone can enjoy it casually without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Just like the many faces of a die, explore a variety of episodes and endings. A single person\u2019s life can lead to countless possibilities\u2014discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Choice:</strong> What will your choice be? Ask yourself and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>bluestruggle</strong> is a one-person indie game development team creating games as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Making games is fun, but it also comes with its fair share of struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To all indie game developers out there\u2014stay healthy and keep going! You got this! \ud83d\udc99\u2728</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Run!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3366060/6001363192